	<Notes name="Notes">
		<Note text_size_multiplier="2" text_color_index="4" text="EarthSearch EP01.  PLAY starts BOTH masters at 00:00 - it is start-from-zero, not a mid-show repair.  STOP stops and resets both.  BANK LOCK is CLEAN / ALL FX OFF, and Cue Level sweeps the same thing (and is how you come back from it, because Avenue has no soft-takeover).  RECORD and the footswitch are blackout.  CUT TO A / CUT TO B, above the master strips, change version without touching a transport.  The 5x8 pad grid addresses the five generative overlay layers ONLY - no pad can reach either master, and every layer ignores column triggers.  FFT is Composition FFT, so it follows the programme audio inside MASTER A with no routing at all." />
	</Notes>
</Composition>
